WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.907
A function separates a reusable calculation from the caller.

00:00:03.907 --> 00:00:07.380
Return produces a value; printing only displays it.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:12.287
A function separates a reusable calculation from the caller.

00:00:12.287 --> 00:00:15.760
Return produces a value; printing only displays it.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:21.008
Modify one input or condition, predict the output, then check your prediction.

00:00:21.008 --> 00:00:23.486
Do not copy only the final output.

00:00:23.486 --> 00:00:27.380
